      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HAY RILEY (5) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 5th (24.81) at Sale. Has performed well from this box with a win and nine minor placings to his name from 18 starts. Looks the one to beat on his best form. DR. BENEDICT (1) was below best last time finishing sixth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Grade 5 win two back at Warragul. Well placed here and can atone this time. CREAM (8) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Was out of the placings last time (23.84) at Warragul in a Grade 4/5, finishing seventh and beaten 11 lengths. Can feature with the right run. WORDS (4) is not to be discarded.",
